c26714f0` (tree `3b52b721c2000b316bcc52a3132d011703089888`). Source PR: #159. The attached qualification and evidence describe the original frozen payloads and scoped checks.\n\nThis patch does not close the broader presentation or navigation phases. Physical touch/controller, zoom, audio/offline and public acceptance are separate checks. The previous v0.64.0 release remains preserved. Pages deployment and its acceptance are recorded separately after publication.\n"}